      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so you're saying the \"right\" way is basically to just tell them that gender is how they feel inside and that's what matters? i'm just a bit worried about how to handle it if they start seeing stuff that says gender is strictly biological and tied to their body. what's the best way to handle those kinds of arguments so i don't confuse them?",
